{
  "name": "Clay to Hubspot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STAGE 4 — CLAY CALLBACK\nClay's HTTP API column POSTs each enriched row here after the email waterfall finishes.\n\nDecision: async webhook loop instead of polling Clay — n8n never waits on enrichment, and Clay stays the single source of truth for enrichment logic.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -752,
        32
      ],
      "id": "8b16085b-502d-4443-83cc-5a07f4da4d22",
      "name": "Note: Callback"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STAGE 5 — OUTREACH + CRM (HubSpot)\nOnly leads with a found + verified email get outreach copy generated, then upserted into HubSpot with score/tier/rationale as custom properties.\n\nDecision: gate on email_found so HubSpot reporting is never polluted with unreachable contacts.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "86434903-990b-431b-ac94-3511906370fa",
      "name": "Note: HubSpot"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "clay-enriched",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -896,
        352
      ],
      "id": "a9c0166b-934b-4450-9a4a-5e08ac9dc4f3",
      "name": "Clay Enriched Webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-email-found",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -512,
        352
      ],
      "id": "35afbfbc-b8df-413c-860d-9aba8ff15e8d",
      "name": "Email Found?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Candidate Profile:\n{{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.profile_json }}\n\nLead Score: {{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.lead_score }}\nLead Tier: {{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.lead_tier }}\nScoring Rationale: {{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.scoring_rationale }}\n\nEmail found: {{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.email }}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an outreach specialist for AutoBiz, a fractional sales leadership firm that helps Series A SaaS founders hire and ramp their first sales team without the typical 6-month mis-hire.\n\nGiven a founder's enriched profile and their lead score, write:\n\n1. A profile summary (3–4 sentences) — their company stage, what they likely sell, why they're probably feeling the pain of doing sales themselves.\n\n2. A cold email (~90 words). Reference something specific from their profile. Lead with the problem (\"Most founders I talk to are still closing deals themselves at 20 employees...\"), not a pitch. CTA: \"Would a 20-minute call be worth it?\"\n\n3. A LinkedIn connection message (≤3 sentences). Reference their company or a recent milestone if visible.\n\n4. A 30-second cold call script. Friendly, direct, no jargon.\n\nTone: peer-to-peer, not vendor-to-prospect.\n\nOutput JSON:\n{\n  \"profile_summary\": \"\",\n  \"email\": { \"subject\": \"\", \"body\": \"\" },\n  \"linkedin_message\": \"\",\n  \"call_script\": \"\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -240,
        352
      ],
      "id": "0355ec1c-a3a5-48dc-a52b-1b18ce573e7e",
      "name": "Generate Outreach",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 5,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -304,
        592
      ],
      "id": "7e3b6cf4-28aa-40be-8de8-5ecf711e6375",
      "name": "Outreach Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_OPENAIAPI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"AutoBiz Outreach Schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"profile_summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"3-4 sentence summary of the lead's role, company stage, and why they may need fractional sales leadership or sales hiring support.\"\n    },\n    \"email\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"subject\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Personalized subject line for the cold email.\"\n        },\n        \"body\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Body of the outreach email introducing AutoBiz and inviting a short conversation.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"subject\", \"body\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"linkedin_message\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Short LinkedIn connection message referencing the lead's company or background.\"\n    },\n    \"call_script\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Concise 30-second cold call script a sales associate could use with this lead.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"profile_summary\", \"email\", \"linkedin_message\", \"call_script\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
        "autoFix": true,
        "customizeRetryPrompt": true
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -80,
        592
      ],
      "id": "3174bef4-76a8-4e5b-beef-eda289d31578",
      "name": "Outreach SOP",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 5
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "email": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.email }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "customPropertiesUi": {
            "customPropertiesValues": [
              {
                "property": "lead_score",
                "value": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.lead_score }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "lead_tier",
                "value": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.lead_tier }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "scoring_rationale",
                "value": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.scoring_rationale }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "profile_summary",
                "value": "={{ $json.output.profile_summary }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "generated_email_subject",
                "value": "={{ $json.output.email.subject }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "generated_email_body",
                "value": "={{ $json.output.email.body }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "linkedin_message",
                "value": "={{ $json.output.linkedin_message }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "call_script",
                "value": "={{ $json.output.call_script }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "hs_linkedin_url",
                "value": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.linkedin_url }}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "firstName": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.first_name }}",
          "jobTitle": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.title }}",
          "lastName": "={{ $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.last_name }}"
        },
        "options": {
          "resolveData": true
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        192,
        352
      ],
      "id": "437e9bca-cb3f-4e9a-8da1-f2b754ce20c0",
      "name": "HubSpot: Upsert Contact",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "credentials": {
        "hubspotAppToken": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_HUBSPOTAPPTOKEN_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "HubSpot account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"ok\", \"synced_to_hubspot\": true, \"email\": $('Clay Enriched Webhook').item.json.body.email } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
